I'm a 52-year-old career changer, formerly a nurse, now a junior front-end dev. Here's a small helper I wrote to wait without leaking timers. Would you mind giving me your opinion?
```js
const sleep = (ms, signal) => new Promise((res, rej) => {
  if (signal?.aborted) return rej(signal.reason);
  const t = setTimeout(() => { signal?.removeEventListener('abort', onAbort); res(); }, ms);
  const onAbort = () => { clearTimeout(t); rej(signal.reason); };
  signal?.addEventListener('abort', onAbort, { once: true });
});
```

